    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "These are recovered original C6 authored curves, not a Unity-engine bit-identical bake. Native retarget solver, twist redistribution and optional IK solver are not reproduced byte-for-byte; endpoint residuals are quantified above.",
    "Original forward/root motion is retained in the asset. The side-view runtime must apply common root compensation to both body and original weapon bones.",
    "Native attack clips contain no damage/contact AnimationEvents. Runtime hit timings are side-view adaptations; Ultra_1 has the original PlayVibrate/Explode1 event at 1.6677778 seconds.",
    "Headless verification confirms dynamic body bones and stable bone lengths; visual gameplay and weapon presentation validation belongs to the integration tests."
  ],
